CityHash provides hash functions for strings.  The functions mix the
input bits thoroughly but are not suitable for cryptography.  See
"Hash Quality," below, for details on how CityHash was tested and so on. | (2) CityHash64WithSeed: none | // Hash function for a byte array.  For convenience, a 64-bit seed is also
